## SQ-HOP-02 | hops item on a log face places a hops vine (north=true, age 0); one hops used
@group A
@commands `/setblock 600 -60 520 minecraft:oak_log`; `/pbot hold G hearthandharvest:hops 2`; `/pbot use G 600 -60 520 south` (south face); `/execute if block 600 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[north=true,age=0]`; `/zhh5 hand G`
@pass "Test passed"; hand count 1
@fails `HHItems.HOPS` (ItemNameBlockItem of the vine), `HopsVineBlock` VineBlock placement
@from batches/r1115/p5_a1.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
# self-contained since r1118 (rowfix-1, 2026-11-18): bot spawn from r1115 p5_a1 P5-setup
> forceload add 576 496 671 559
> execute unless entity G run pbot spawn G 615 -60 512 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> setblock 600 -60 520 minecraft:oak_log
> clear G
> pbot hold G hearthandharvest:hops 2
> pbot use G 600 -60 520 south
> execute if block 600 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[north=true,age=0] run say HOP02-vine
> cdevtest player G
waitlog verb=player done= 20
expect HOP02-vine$
expect verb=player name=G .*main=hearthandharvest:hops\*1
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=\S+ done=0

## SQ-HOP-03 | hops vine grows to age 3 at randomTickSpeed 3000 in 10 s (open sky, mid autumn)
@group A
@commands `/setblock 602 -60 520 minecraft:oak_log`; `/setblock 602 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[north=true,age=0]`; `/cdevtest randomtick 602 -60 521 602 -60 521 150` (was randomTickSpeed 3000 for 10 s); `/execute if block 602 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[age=3]`; `/gamerule randomTickSpeed 3`
@pass "Test passed" (open sky, light 15). Out of season the crop season may stop growth: run at an in-season date
@fails `HopsVineBlock.randomTick` (1 in 5, light 9 at the block above), crop season tag `autumn_fruit`
@from batches/r1115/p5_a1.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> setblock 602 -60 520 minecraft:oak_log
> setblock 602 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[north=true,age=0]
> zmelt w hop03 overworld 602 -60 521
> zmelt light overworld 602 -59 521
> cdevtest randomtick 602 -60 521 602 -60 521 150
