## SQ-HOP-04 | stick pick: age 3 gives 1 or 2 hops and goes to age 1 (x3); ages 2 and 1 are not picked (rewritten 2026-11-16, R5)
@group A
@commands `/setblock 604 -60 520 minecraft:oak_log`; `/setblock 604 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[north=true,age=3]`; `/pbot hold G minecraft:stick 1`; `/pbot use G 604 -60 521 north`; `/execute if block 604 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[age=1]`; `/zhh5 items 604 -60 521 3`; repeat 3 times; then `age=2` once: stays age 2, no hops; then `age=1`: use does nothing
@pass "Test passed"; age 3 gives 1 or 2 `hearthandharvest:hops`; age 2 and age 1 are not picked (stay, no item; since 2026-11-16 a vine is picked only at age 3)
@fails `HopsVineBlock.use` (age < 3 must pass for a non-fertilizer item)
@reviewed 2026-11-16
@from batches/r1115/p5_a1.qb
